id: hex
path: hex.html
title: Hex
icon: 0x
source: runtime/stdlib_codecs.cpp
description.ru: Lowercase hexadecimal codec для байтов.
description.en: A lowercase hexadecimal codec for bytes.
note.ru: Pure. Lenient decode принимает пробелы, `:`, `-` и prefix 0x.
note.en: Pure. Lenient decode accepts whitespace, `:`, `-` and a 0x prefix.
drift_ignore:

method: Hex.encode(bytes)
ru: Кодирует байты в lowercase hex.
en: Encodes bytes as lowercase hex.
example:
text = Hex.encode(Bytes.new("hi"))
# => "6869"
.end

method: Hex.decode(text, mode: :strict)
ru: Декодирует hex-текст в Bytes.
en: Decodes hex text into Bytes.
example:
text = Hex.decode("68 69", mode: :lenient).to_str()
# => "hi"
.end
